  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Savage Wilderness Great World’s main forces fight Yellow Earth Great World inhabitants. A six legged black tiger as large as a mountain charges through the sky, grabs a Yellow Earth Gu Immortal, tears that immortal in two, and laughs as blood covers its face. Yellow Earth voices name the killer as Hei Liu Biao. Aerial morale collapses and Yellow Earth Gu Immortals want to retreat.",
      "chapters": [
        2156
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_savage_wilderness_great_world",
        "loc_yellow_earth_great_world",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Xiao He Jian and other Fang Yuan subordinates reach Hei Liu Biao and Xue Li Du. Yellow Earth survivors warn that the two are powerful rank eight experts from Savage Wilderness Great World. Xiao He Jian claims the mountain-like six legged black tiger for himself. Hei Liu Biao roars that no Gu Immortal has treated it with such an attitude and charges in a frenzy. After a joint assault it crashes into a deep crater, holds onto its last breath with six tiger claws twitching, and is killed. Gu Immortals at rank eight then split up its corpse for contribution points.",
      "chapters": [
        2158
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_xiao_he_jian",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_xue_li_du"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Bing Sai Chuan later reads that Hei Liu Biao and Xue Li Du, powerful rank eight experts in Savage Wilderness Great World, died so easily to Fang Yuan’s force.",
